		(property "Notes" "ICHG pin 50/11.8 = 4.24 A per port (4.07-4.45 A over K_ICHG and 1 %). Kept at 11.8k on 2026-11-07 (BAK 65E; the 0 Ohm plan was dropped): config sets EN_ICHG_PIN = 0, so ICHG_REG is the limit and firmware keeps both ports at 4.55 A total on the cell-temperature ramp (docs/firmware/charge-and-thermal-policy.md). This pin only caps current if a watchdog reset or power cycle restores EN_ICHG_PIN = 1 with no host. EN_CHG_BIT_RESET_BEHAVIOR = 0"
